        },
        "description": "Loosely based off of Osamu Tezuka&#039;s classic character, &quot;Astro Boy,&quot; Atom of the &quot;Pluto&quot; series is a highly developed robot. He is constantly classified as one of the worlds top seven robotic technological advances in science, to the point that even Gesicht&#039;s sensors have trouble distinguishing him as a robot or human.  He works with Gesicht in order to help discover the truth behind the recent chain of murders. He has a sister, Uran.",
